flowchart TD
  A[Payment event - gateway webhook] --> B{Payment verified: Paid + gateway id + paid_at?}
  B -- No --> X1[EXCEPTION: PAYMENT_NOT_VERIFIED / PARTIAL_PAYMENT -> Finance Ops]
  B -- Yes --> C[Reconcile to invoice - exact id]
  C --> D{Duplicate invoice?}
  D -- Yes --> X2[EXCEPTION: DUPLICATE_INVOICE -> Finance Ops]
  D -- No --> E[Student identity: student_id + user_id vs reference]
  E --> F{Same-batch renewal?}
  F -- Batch change --> X3[EXCEPTION: MANUAL_REVIEW -> Scheduling Ops + parent choice]
  F -- Same batch --> G{Teacher form needed? optional}
  G -- Form present --> H[Compare amount, teacher, course, contact]
  G -- No form --> H2[Derive from invoice + reference]
  H --> I
  H2 --> I{All checks pass? amount = fee, contact matches, batch active, seat OK, no conflict}
  I -- No --> X4[EXCEPTION queue -> owner by reason code]
  I -- Yes --> J{Booking already exists?}
  J -- Yes --> K[Continue from existing booking - never create another]
  J -- No --> L[AUTO-APPROVE -> create booking once - idempotency key]
  L --> M[Create schedule rows]
  K --> M
  M --> N[Parent WhatsApp confirmation]
  X1 --> Q[Owner assignment -> follow-up -> human approval -> re-run reconciliation]
  X2 --> Q
  X3 --> Q
  X4 --> Q
  Q --> I
